WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.690
«Nobody answers me.»

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.670
It's almost never true. You just never followed up.

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.840
With RelAI nobody gets lost.

4
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:08.570
First follow-up after five days.

5
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.130
The second after five more.

6
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.230
Then once a month, forever.

7
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.840
Never the same message.

8
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.550
Never «did you see my message?»

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.850
The result is in the follow-up.
